WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.448 --> 00:00:06.552
"Eww! Frog tongue!"

2
00:00:16.222 --> 00:00:20.466
cried. Roxy pulled herself from the tongue just as the frog's mouth closed.

3
00:00:21.507 --> 00:00:23.128
Snap! "Eww!

4
00:00:23.288 --> 00:00:24.089
Eww! Eww!"

5
00:00:24.469 --> 00:00:26.752
cried Roxy, jumping back down to the street.

6
00:00:30.092 --> 00:00:30.492
"This is so gross!

7
00:00:30.652 --> 00:00:35.455
I don't think I can—" Another frog tongue flicked toward Roxy.

8
00:00:35.475 --> 00:00:38.016
Thwap! "Whoa!"

9
00:00:38.877 --> 00:00:40.278
she cried, jumping out of the way.

10
00:00:41.898 --> 00:00:45.140
Thwap! "Aah!"

11
00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.881
Roxy yelled, looking around.

12
00:00:47.862 --> 00:00:49.462
Giant frogs crept everywhere.

13
00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:53.325
"How am I going to get rid of all these frogs?"

14
00:00:53.665 --> 00:00:54.405
Roxy wondered.

15
00:00:54.425 --> 00:01:00.569
"If they were anything else—squirrels, chipmunks, turtles—no problem.

16
00:01:01.609 --> 00:01:03.550
I would just pick them up.

17
00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:06.092
But I do not want to touch any frogs!"

18
00:01:08.093 --> 00:01:09.493
Ribbit! Ribbit!

19
00:01:10.554 --> 00:01:13.235
A fat green frog with brown spots stared at Roxy.

20
00:01:14.176 --> 00:01:15.296
Roxy took a step back.

21
00:01:16.237 --> 00:01:18.458
But then she realized another frog was behind her.

22
00:01:19.739 --> 00:01:21.079
She looked in the alley to her right.

23
00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:24.061
A frog was squeezed between the two buildings.

24
00:01:25.282 --> 00:01:27.363
To Roxy's left, another frog croaked.

25
00:01:28.303 --> 00:01:29.424
Roxy was surrounded.

26
00:01:30.224 --> 00:01:32.806
Everywhere she looked, she saw the bulging eyes of frogs.

27
00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:34.667
They all stared at her.

28
00:01:35.668 --> 00:01:37.329
"Ugh!" said Roxy.

29
00:01:37.349 --> 00:01:40.952
"This is the grossest mission I've ever been on!"

30
00:01:41.913 --> 00:01:43.214
Detective Smith called to her.

31
00:01:44.175 --> 00:01:44.975
"Rocket Girl!

32
00:01:45.195 --> 00:01:46.016
Are you okay?"

33
00:01:46.036 --> 00:01:48.318
"Of course I'm not okay!"

34
00:01:48.538 --> 00:01:49.258
yelled Roxy.

35
00:01:49.278 --> 00:01:51.900
"I'm about to be frog food!"

36
00:01:52.881 --> 00:01:55.223
All at once the frogs' sticky tongues shot out.

37
00:01:57.532 --> 00:02:00.614
Thwap! Roxy blasted straight up, getting out of the way just in time.

38
00:02:02.575 --> 00:02:04.776
Below her the four frogs were stuck together.

39
00:02:04.796 --> 00:02:07.638
"Ha-ha!" Roxy laughed.

40
00:02:08.638 --> 00:02:12.581
Croak! A very slimy frog jumped into the air after Roxy.

41
00:02:14.201 --> 00:02:15.182
Roxy flew fast.

42
00:02:16.203 --> 00:02:18.564
The slimy frog hopped along the tops of buildings.

43
00:02:19.484 --> 00:02:21.425
Wherever Roxy flew, the frog hopped.

44
00:02:22.766 --> 00:02:25.588
Roxy zigzagged through the air with the frog right behind her.

45
00:02:26.552 --> 00:02:29.033
Soon Roxy flew over the lake in Metro City Park.

46
00:02:29.053 --> 00:02:31.233
"What happened to the lake?"

47
00:02:31.553 --> 00:02:32.274
Roxy wondered.

48
00:02:33.334 --> 00:02:34.594
"The water is purple!"

49
00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:38.055
Just then another frog leaped from behind a tree.

50
00:02:39.756 --> 00:02:42.836
It smashed into Roxy and sent her crashing down into the lake.

51
00:02:43.757 --> 00:02:46.217
While Roxy was underwater, she saw something odd.

52
00:02:47.158 --> 00:02:49.158
A mysterious rock sat on the lake floor.

53
00:02:50.058 --> 00:02:51.579
The rock glowed bright purple.

54
00:02:51.599 --> 00:02:55.540
"That looks like a meteor," thought Roxy.

55
00:02:56.828 --> 00:02:59.511
As she studied the meteor, she began to feel strange.

56
00:02:59.531 --> 00:03:02.835
"What's going on?"

57
00:03:03.135 --> 00:03:04.817
Roxy wondered, becoming dizzy.

58
00:03:05.778 --> 00:03:07.780
She felt as if she was moving really fast.

59
00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:09.742
But she wasn't moving at all.

60
00:03:09.762 --> 00:03:12.445
"Uh-oh!" thought Roxy.

61
00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.872
"I think I'm growing!"
